appletbdrm: port T1 resume and DRM PRIME import to Debian Linux 6.12

The T1 panel unpark changes are from Nicolas Nistal, upstream PR #49
(26f6ef618811296e4e19ca210ef08ff4b4283f00).
The 6.12 adaptation retains the USB DMA-device reference via DRM-managed cleanup.

